From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Fallin <chris@cfallin.org>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:30:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add hooks to allow for an external compiler

The JS_EXTERNAL_COMPILER_HOOKS surface (js/public/ExternalCompilerHooks.h,
--enable-external-compiler-hooks): object-model, script-entry, GC and
regexp hooks an external compilation tier plugs into, the private-header
export and the jsshell static library.

Source commits in YurtOS/firefox (yurt dff5cf534448):
  164f660a3602 Add hooks to allow for an external compiler.
    (all included paths except build/moz.configure, config/system-headers.mozbuild)
  f6cb6f9ddc21 Review feedback.
    (all included paths)
