+# The JS shell as a static library (--enable-external-compiler-hooks): the
+# shell minus main() and the wizer entry point, so an external compiler tier
+# can link its own shell around js::shell::ShellMain with a ShellExtension
+# registered. The archive folds in the shell's static dependencies (mozglue,
+# mfbt); the engine itself stays in libjs_static.a. Everything an external
+# link needs is installed under dist/lib.
